  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '                                     You have reached Safa Mountain.


    Remember
    the story of Hajar, who ran between these hills in search of water for her son,
    Ismail (peace be upon them). This act of devotion and trust in Allah is commemorated
    during the Sai ritual. Take a moment to reflect on the perseverance and faith
    shown by Hajar. When you are ready, proceed towards Marwa.'
